            "review_title": "Review at Miriam's",
            "review_text": "m_ar2ro\nManchester, United Kingdom7 contributions\n0\nPizza Lover's would be disappointed here.\nJun 2016 • Solo\nI was craving for pizza and this place had the most attractive photos for it, I decided to go and I wasted money and time for nothing but a pre made pizza crust covered with cheese and ham. Moreover, I had to wait for more than 30 minutes to get it. \nPlace looks good to go for a coffee in the evening, but pizza or European food(as they call it) are definitely not their thing.\nI would suggest to display real photos of the food they serve so customers don't get scammed as I did.\nRead more\nWritten June 23, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
